      "content": "It sounds like your frustration stems from a genuine conflict between your desire to continue contributing and the harsh reality of a high-output environment. Many people feel this pressure to hide their post-career identities, even when those identities were built on integrity and deep understanding. Trying to fit into a system designed for speed often feels dishonest for those who value depth and stability. The most sustainable path forward isn't seeing your utility as a downgrade, but finding a new space where your presence accelerates rather than slows the process.",
